     Your premise is flawed.  If you don't ascend or escape
the dungeon, the only things you could leave at a base camp
which would affect your score are gold pieces.  Those are
the only things you can carry which matter to the score for
deaths or quitting.

     So if you care about the score that much, just carry
all your gold.  Leaving it behind reduces your score, but
gold is usually a very small part of the final score anyway.
Killing monsters yields the most points by far.



